# Example production deployment for a bare-metal/non-Docker install: Caddy
# terminates TLS (automatic cert via Let's Encrypt) and reverse-proxies to
# arxd, which should be started with its default `--rpc-bind 127.0.0.1`
# (loopback-only, not internet-facing). For the Docker deployment, see
# docker-compose.prod.yml + Caddyfile.prod instead — same idea, arxd on the
# private compose network rather than host loopback.
#
#   arxd --base-path /var/lib/arxium --port 30333
#   caddy run --config Caddyfile
#
arxium.example.com {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:30333
}
